Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:34:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 33/34] metal: band-limited FFTs mirroring ducc0 ufirst/vfirst

Per-plane occupied line ranges from the centered-frame tap footprints;
FFT axis-0 over occupied columns (or axis-1 over occupied rows), then
the other axis over dirty rows/cols only. Skipped lines are zeros so
this is exact up to strided-FFT rounding (~1e-7). 4096: FFT 19.7s->9.7s,
total 37.6s->30.5s. T2 passes (4.78e-06).

